WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.178
Many different animals lay eggs.

2
00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:12.565
Baby animals grow inside them.

3
00:00:12.566 --> 00:00:16.813
One day the eggs will hatch.

4
00:00:16.814 --> 00:00:20.076
What animals will come out of them?

5
00:00:20.077 --> 00:00:24.196
These eggs rest in sand.

6
00:00:24.197 --> 00:00:28.384
The eggs are very soft.

7
00:00:28.385 --> 00:00:35.021
One night they hatch.

8
00:00:35.022 --> 00:00:40.064
The animals are sea turtles!

9
00:00:40.065 --> 00:00:44.553
The sea turtles crawl across the beach.

10
00:00:44.554 --> 00:00:48.809
They swim away in the ocean.

11
00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:52.552
These eggs sit in a nest.

12
00:00:52.553 --> 00:01:00.246
The eggs have a smooth, hard shell.

13
00:01:00.247 --> 00:01:02.832
Crack!

14
00:01:02.833 --> 00:01:08.514
Owlets poke out their heads!

15
00:01:08.515 --> 00:01:11.804
The parents feed them worms.

16
00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:17.670
One day the owlets fly away!

17
00:01:17.671 --> 00:01:21.401
These tiny eggs float in a pond.

18
00:01:21.402 --> 00:01:24.327
Jelly covers the eggs.

19
00:01:24.328 --> 00:01:29.008
One day they hatch into tadpoles.

20
00:01:29.009 --> 00:01:32.325
Soon tiny legs grow.

21
00:01:32.326 --> 00:01:36.417
The tadpoles' tails shrink.

22
00:01:36.418 --> 00:01:39.870
They are frogs now!

23
00:01:39.871 --> 00:01:43.571
These tiny eggs stick to a leaf.

24
00:01:43.572 --> 00:01:48.592
Caterpillars hatch from the eggs.

25
00:01:48.593 --> 00:01:52.994
The caterpillars eat leaves and grow.

26
00:01:52.995 --> 00:01:57.624
Then their bodies become hard.

27
00:01:57.625 --> 00:02:02.494
They don't move for two weeks.

28
00:02:02.495 --> 00:02:07.412
Finally, beautiful butterflies pop out!

29
00:02:07.413 --> 00:02:12.039
Many different animals hatch from eggs.

30
00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:17.042
Which one is your favorite?

